+    <section class="board-content"><div class="welcome-row"><div><div class="eyebrow" id="dateLabel">YOUR SPACE, YOUR PACE</div><h1 id="greeting">Good morning<span>.</span></h1><p class="subtitle">Make room for what matters.</p></div><button class="primary-btn" id="newTask"><span>＋</span> New task</button></div>
